  "answer": "三项工作已经全部完成，并通过现有单元测试验证：\n\n1. **numbers.total**  \n   - 实现：`return sum(value for value in values if value is not None)`  \n   - 行为：忽略 `None`，保留 0 和负数；空列表或只含 `None` 时返回 0。  \n   - 验证：`test_numbers.py` 通过。\n\n2. **labels.normalize**  \n   - 实现：`return value.strip().lower()`  \n   - 行为：去除首尾空白，转为小写，内部空格原样保留。  \n   - 验证：`test_labels.py` 通过。\n\n3. **README.md**  \n   - 已增加 `numbers.total` 和 `labels.normalize` 的行为说明，并给出与代码和测试一致的示例，包括：  \n     - `total([2, None, -1, 0]) -> 1`、`total([None]) -> 0`、`total([]) -> 0`  \n     - `normalize(' A B ') -> 'a b'`、`normalize('  ') -> ''`、`normalize('Hello  World') -> 'hello  world'`\n\n验证命令 `/Users/tusima/Documents/学习/tsm-agt/.venv/bin/python -m unittest discover -s . -p 'test_*.py'` 已运行，全部 4 个测试通过。Todo 中三项任务也都标记为完成。",
  "changed_files": [
    "labels.py",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "final_files": {
    "numbers.py": "def total(values):\n    return sum(value for value in values if value is not None)\n",
    "labels.py": "def normalize(value):\n    \"\"\"Normalize a label by stripping leading/trailing whitespace and\n    converting to lowercase, while preserving internal spaces.\n    \"\"\"\n    return value.strip().lower()\n",
    "README.md": "# Helpers\n\nPython helper utilities.\n\n## numbers.total\n\n`total(values)` 返回所有非 None 数值的和，保留零和负数。空输入或只包含 None 的输入返回 0。\n\n示例：\n\n- `total([2, None, -1, 0])` → `1`\n- `total([None])` → `0`\n- `total([])` → `0`\n\n## labels.normalize\n\n`normalize(value)` 去除首尾空白字符，将剩余内容转为小写，并保留内部空格。\n\n示例：\n\n- `normalize(' A B ')` → `'a b'`\n- `normalize('  ')` → `''`\n- `normalize('Hello  World')` → `'hello  world'`\n",
    "test_numbers.py": "import unittest\nfrom numbers import total\n\nclass NumbersTest(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_total(self):\n        self.assertEqual(total([2, None, -1, 0]), 1)\n    def test_empty(self):\n        self.assertEqual(total([None]), 0)\n",
    "test_labels.py": "import unittest\nfrom labels import normalize\n\nclass LabelsTest(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_normalize(self):\n        self.assertEqual(normalize(' A B '), 'a b')\n    def test_empty(self):\n        self.assertEqual(normalize('  '), '')\n"
  },
